# Devlish-native curriculum checks for class-style lessons

Scenario "lesson 1 calculates wages"
When I run "../01_payroll_calculator.dvl" method "calculate_wages" with [40, 25]
Then run should succeed
Then return value should equal 1000
Then wages should equal 1000

Scenario "lesson 2 classifies catch up participants"
When I run "../02_participant_classifier.dvl" method "classify_participant" with [52]
Then run should succeed
Then return value should equal "catch_up"
Then participant_status should equal "catch_up"

Scenario "lesson 3 reviews large invoices"
When I run "../03_private_helper.dvl" method "review_invoice" with [12000]
Then run should succeed
Then return value should equal true
Then review_needed should equal true
